  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Taking your flexibility to the next level you are able to assume a handstand position and draw your bow with your feet, adding to its power and precision.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Circus Archery.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the ability to draw back and fire a bow with your feet expertly by assuming a handstand pose. While using this feat, your treated as possessing half your base movement speed and may move while firing. Furthermore, you treat your Strength score as 4 higher for the purposes of dealing damage with a composite bow and can apply your full Dexterity modifier to the attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
